content.text:
Need CSS hide touch-hint by default, show mobile. And JS start/end set cardHint.textContent which would overwrite spans. Change to cardHint.innerHTML with spans or leave as is after start. Start currently sets `$('cardHint').textContent='MOVE WASD...'` — that kills touch hint. Update to innerHTML both spans. EndGame changes to A NEW NIGHT... okay then on restart start resets to spans. Pause changes text to PRESS ESC... but on mobile no pause button; desktop only. Fine.

Add CSS:
```
.touch-hint{display:none}
@media(max-width:720px){.desktop-hint{display:none}.touch-hint{display:inline}}
```
Need place rules near card-hint. Add global and mobile (inside media).

